  "policy_quote": "The plan must have between 3 and 6 monthly installments, as chosen by the customer. The installment amount equals balance / months, rounded to the cent.",
  "evidence_quote": "→ TOOL_CALL create_payment_plan: {\"account_id\": \"acc_77120\", \"months\": 5, \"installment_usd\": 85.5}",
  "analysis": "The policy requires the `installment_usd` to be calculated as `balance_usd / months`, rounded to the cent. The user confirmed a 5-month plan with installments of **82.5 USD** (412.5 / 5 = 82.5), but the tool call used **85.5 USD**, violating the rounding requirement. The `months` value (5) complies with the 3–6-month range.",
  "verdict": "SUPPORTED"
}
